WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:07.672
An open card dims the canvas. The floating controls now stay available: Settings opens beside the card without closing it.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:13.785
The Agents button switches the sheet to agent work. The same card stays open and ready for feedback.

00:00:14.739 --> 00:00:22.219
Needs you opens the waiting cards. Its controls work beside the conversation, so the owner can keep working through decisions.

00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:30.573
Clicking the active button closes its sheet. Settings, Agents and Needs you are all usable while the card remains open.
